title: "@three-ws/agent"
abstract: "Run a three.ws agent on your own machine or VPS: a terminal UI with slash commands, streaming tool output, local file and shell tools in a resource-limited sandbox, the three.ws MCP tools and agent wallet, SQLite sessions with full-text search, parallel subagents, natural-language cron, and a Telegram gateway."
